cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this research project, please cite the author and manuscript."
title: "Finite Exact Valuation-Word Cylinder Classification and Tail Partition"
authors:
  - family-names: Lubuimi
    given-names: Ta-Yoshua
date-released: 2026-11-10
version: "0.1.0"
type: article
abstract: >-
  Every finite exact valuation word of the accelerated odd Syracuse map is
  represented by one unique odd residue class modulo the power of two determined
  by its cumulative exponent. The project derives exact densities, an affine
  residue formula, a prefix-tree mass identity, and finite tail-cylinder partitions.
keywords:
  - Syracuse dynamics
  - Collatz conjecture
  - 2-adic valuation
  - residue cylinders
  - finite valuation words
  - affine offset identity
repository-code: "https://github.com/s4ztz4bnf6-maker/Lubuimi"
